            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Vdog"
            },
            "reviewBody": "What a great technique for cooking walleye! I used lemon, pepper, and Greek seasoning (what I had on hand) and loved the simplicity. Good walleye doesn't need much more. My only problem is my husband brought home a huge fish, so it took triple the time to cook. I can't wait to make this again with normal sized filets!",
